Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: q6apm: add token-checked FullIO calibration SET_CFG

Build bounded in-band or mapped OOB SET_CFG packets for future use by the
FullIO frontend. Require both enabled transports and do not reuse an OOB
buffer after a failed command. No call sites or gain controls are enabled.

